    "body": "> Di changed the PR to use shadow-including root rather than comparing the document, I think we now also collapse the composed selection range which is correct IMO.\r\n\r\nBut shadow-including root will climb up to the document, if the node is connected. So I don't think there's a difference here. I believe the spec does not collapse in this case, because it is basically doing a same-document comparison check.",
